%% Interrupt and resume — interrupt + Command(resume)
sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Orchestrator_LangGraph
  participant CP as Checkpointer
  participant H as Human
  participant A as ApprovalService
  O->>O: interrupt payload in node
  CP-->>O: state persisted by runtime
  O->>H: surface interrupt
  H->>A: approve or revise
  A->>A: record Approval
  A->>O: resume value
  O->>O: Command resume same thread_id
  Note over O: node restarts; code before interrupt re-runs
  O->>CP: auto checkpoint after continue
